  {
   "n": 6,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>Consider voice transmission using BPSK signalling at a transmission rate of 4.8 kbps and a bandwidth efficiency of 1 bps/Hz. In order to increase the data rate to 38.4 kbps with the symbol rate to remain at 4800 symbols/sec, the number of points required in the signal constellation will be _______.</p>",
